{"type":"message","id":"80fb42b1","parentId":"221a83c6","timestamp":"2026-05-27T23:41:47.657Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-05-28 07:41 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 修复 Binance Testnet 平仓时 `reduceOnly` 被拒的问题。需要修改两个文件：\n\n## 1. `/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/binance_auto_trade.py`\n\n`place_order` 函数中（约第 449-453 行），当前代码：\n```python\n    if reduce_only:\n        order_params[\"reduceOnly\"] = \"true\"\n```\n\n改为**不再传入 `reduceOnly` 参数**。因为在一币种单边模式（positionSide=BOTH）下，反向下单同数量自然就是平仓，不需要 reduceOnly 标记。Binance Testnet 对这个标记会报 code -2022。\n\n同时保留 `reduce_only` 参数本身不变（其他地方可能还在调用），只是不让它传到 API 请求里。\n\n## 2. `/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/manual_trade.py`\n\n`cmd_close` 函数中（约第 166-171 行），当前调用：\n```python\n    result = bat.place_order(\n        symbol=f\"{symbol}USDT\",\n        side=side,\n        quantity=qty,\n        price=price,\n        reduce_only=True,\n    )\n```\n改为 `reduce_only=False`（或者去掉这个参数，因为 binance_auto_trade.py 改完后传 True 也不会传 API 了，但显式传 False 更清晰）。\n\n改完后进行验证测试：\n\n```bash\ncd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts\npython3 -c \"\nimport sys, json, logging\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nlogging.disable(logging.CRITICAL)\nfrom binance_auto_trade import place_order, get_all_positions\n\n# 1. 验证 place_order 调用不会报错\n# 用小量模拟平仓测试（不实际成交，因为数量很小或不存在该持仓）\nprint('=== 测试传入 reduce_only=True ===')\ntry:\n    # 获取一个已有持仓来测试\n    positions = get_all_positions()\n    print(f'当前持仓数: {len(positions)}')\n    for p in positions:\n        sym = p['symbol']\n        amt = float(p.get('positionAmt', 0))\n        side = 'SELL' if amt > 0 else 'BUY'\n        qty = abs(amt)\n        print(f'  {sym}: amt={amt}, close_side={side}, qty={qty}')\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f'查询持仓异常: {e}')\n\nprint()\nprint('=== 验证代码修改 ===')\nimport inspect\nsrc = inspect.getsource(place_order)\nif 'reduceOnly' in src:\n    print('❌ 仍有 reduceOnly API 参数')\nelse:\n    print('✅ reduceOnly API 参数已移除')\n\"\n```\n\n注意：不要真的下单测试（开仓会消耗测试资金）。只做代码验证和逻辑检查。"}],"timestamp":1779925307638}}
